<StandardPageLayout title="Security" headline="Security" description="Report a security concern or an incorrect web-filter classification for TheAngrySquirrel.">
  <p>TheAngrySquirrel is Patrick Rich’s professional portfolio and personal journal, including communication, video, photography, automotive writing, overlanding, amateur radio, and software projects.</p>
  <h2>Report a security concern</h2>
  <p>Email <a href="mailto:patrickprich@angrysquirrel.org">patrickprich@angrysquirrel.org</a> with the affected URL, a description of the issue, and steps to reproduce it. Please avoid sending passwords, private data, or access tokens. Do not access other people’s data or disrupt the service.</p>
  <h2>Website filtering</h2>
  <p>If a workplace filter blocks the site, its administrator controls access. You can report a suspected classification error to the filtering provider or email the site owner with the provider’s name, affected URL, category, and a screenshot with private information removed.</p>
  <p>Contact information for automated tools is available in <a href="/.well-known/security.txt">security.txt</a>. This contact page is not a security certification.</p>
</StandardPageLayout>
